💭 One field of a shape: its name, what kind of value it is, and the bounds that kind
💭 has. The kinds are 0 a text, 1 an integer, 2 a number, 3 a boolean and 4 a choice. A
💭 text's bounds are its least and most characters, and an integer's its lowest and
💭 highest, in the same two numbers.
